<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
  <h2>Visitor FAQs</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>What are your opening times?</h3>
    <p>We are open every day of the year from 9am to 6pm, including weekends and bank holidays.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>How long should I allow for my visit?</h3>
    <p>Visitors usually spend around two to three hours exploring all four zones.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Is the aquarium accessible for wheelchair users?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Every zone has step-free access, with ramps and lifts throughout the building.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Can I touch any of the animals?</h3>
    <p>Yes. In the Rockpools zone, our Touch Pool Experience lets you gently handle starfish and anemones with guidance from our staff.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Is there any food available on site?</h3>
    <p>Our café serves hot and cold food, and you are welcome to bring your own picnic.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>How does Aquarium World support conservation?</h3>
    <p>We take part in breeding programmes for endangered species and run beach clean events with local volunteers in the community.</p>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>